WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:01.176 --> 00:00:05.826
2026 is really AI's takeoff
year, and I think there are

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.667
three trends to be watching.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:13.557
So if you want to separate the signal from
the noise, watch what's happening in terms

00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:16.317
of capability as well as competition.

00:00:16.737 --> 00:00:21.447
And by the former, I mean what's happening
at the frontier of what AI is able to do.

00:00:21.817 --> 00:00:24.057
The capability is accelerating.

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:28.157
For over a decade, we've heard
about how AI is gonna hit a wall.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.887
That certainly does not
seem to be the case.

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:35.117
The capability is not only accelerating,
but the competition, the second

00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:40.587
part, is leading to this intense
reordering of the geopolitical order.

00:00:40.587 --> 00:00:44.157
And by competition, I'm not only talking
about the competition between the labs.

00:00:44.157 --> 00:00:48.087
Of course, there's fierce competition
between the labs, but really how this is

00:00:48.087 --> 00:00:51.557
a geopolitical competition, which I think
is gonna be the definitive geopolitical

00:00:51.777 --> 00:00:53.697
competition of the twenty-first century.

00:00:53.897 --> 00:00:56.287
Because ultimately,
what are we doing here?

00:00:56.487 --> 00:01:01.537
We are manufacturing non-biological
intelligence, and those who are

00:01:01.557 --> 00:01:05.887
able to control the production and
deployment of that intelligence are

00:01:05.887 --> 00:01:10.282
gonna have an extreme and compounding
edge, both economically as well

00:01:10.282 --> 00:01:11.592
as from a security perspective.

00:01:11.642 --> 00:01:16.052
So as the capability accelerates,
the competition accelerates, too.

00:01:16.232 --> 00:01:18.552
And then there's a third category
signal we should be looking at,

00:01:18.602 --> 00:01:19.832
and those are the constraints.

00:01:19.852 --> 00:01:24.882
this is going to be decisive for both the
capability as well as the competition.

00:01:25.082 --> 00:01:28.242
When it comes to the constraints, we
know about the physical constraints.

00:01:28.242 --> 00:01:34.092
We know how non-biological intelligence
is an industrial production and supply

